  "details": "The amount of times you have to click \"Back\" inside an instance selection depends on how many times you clicked the instances\n\nRe-pro:\nOpen the menu -> Open any world that has at least 2 or more instances, (1 click onto the instance adds up 1 click to the \"back\" button) -> Click like 5 times onto random instances -> go \"Back\" (It needs to be pressed as many times as you selected instances+1)\n\nVideo: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SJOh2udhr1E\n\nTested on: Build 864",
